    rdf:value """Wednesday, Apr. 8, 1908
I  Tatti.
Fine.
Scott.
Lunched at Placci’s with Salvemini and Schlumberger.  Bernhard went to Brauer’s and I picked Scott up at the Uffizi.Chatted in evening .
[photo of the grotta and retaining wall at Gamberaia] """^^xsd:string ;
